{"seq":3,"slug":"yield-farming-risks","title":"流动性挖矿与风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/yield-farming-risks","wordCount":2572,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"流动性挖矿与风险\">流动性挖矿与风险</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流动性挖矿是把资金提供给 DEX 的流动性池以换取交易费（以及可能的代币激励）的策略。它的收益看起来由 APY 表达，但真实回报必须扣除<strong>无常损失</strong>与<strong>代币贬值</strong>后才能判断。</p>\n<p><strong>定义与要素</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>自动做市商（AMM）</strong>：用数学公式与流动性池替代订单簿；恒定乘积公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\times y = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是其经典形式。</li>\n<li><strong>LP 与 LP Token</strong>：流动性提供者按等价值存入两种代币，获得代表池中份额的 LP Token，按份额分配手续费。</li>\n<li><strong>无常损失（Impermanent Loss, IL）</strong>：价格比变化使 LP 资产价值低于简单持有（HODL）的差额，公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IL = \\frac{2\\sqrt{r}}{1+r} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4413em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4739em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8059em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>真实收益（Real Yield）</strong>：来自协议实际经济活动的收入（手续费、利差、清算），与靠代币增发补贴的收益相对。</li>\n<li><strong>代币激励（Emissions）</strong>：协议用自身代币补贴流动性，激励停止即流失，是可预测的不可持续来源。</li>\n<li><strong>集中流动性（Uniswap V3）</strong>：在指定价格区间提供流动性以提高资本效率，但同时放大无常损失。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>收益与风险的构成</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>决定因素</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交易手续费</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>交易量、费率、资本效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代币激励</td>\n<td>+</td>\n<td>激励计划、代币价格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无常损失</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>价格比变化幅度与速度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gas/操作成本</td>\n<td>−</td>\n<td>链上费用、操作频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>「APY 就是收益」</strong>——APY 通常只反映手续费与激励，未扣除无常损失与代币贬值；须计算「去掉激励后 APY 是否仍为正」。</li>\n<li><strong>「无常损失会恢复」</strong>——只有当价格比回到初始才消失；若永久偏离，它就成为实际损失（故英文常用 divergence loss）。</li>\n<li><strong>「集中流动性一定更优」</strong>——它放大资本效率的同时等比例放大无常损失，且需要主动管理。</li>\n<li><strong>「TVL 大就安全」</strong>——TVL 可能是靠高激励短期堆出来的，激励停止后即撤离。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"流动性挖矿概述\">流动性挖矿概述</h2><p>流动性挖矿（Yield Farming / Liquidity Mining）是通过向去中心化交易所（DEX）的自动做市商（AMM）提供流动性来获取交易费和代币奖励的策略。它是 DeFi 中收益最高但风险也最复杂的活动之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"amm-基本原理\">AMM 基本原理</h3><p>传统交易所使用订单簿匹配买卖方，而 AMM 使用数学公式和流动性池替代订单簿：</p>\n<p><strong>恒定乘积公式（Uniswap V2）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x \\times y = k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 分别是池中两种代币的数量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是常数。</p>\n<p><strong>流动性提供者（LP）</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>存入等价值的两种代币（如 ETH + USDC）</li>\n<li>获得 LP Token 代表其在池中的份额</li>\n<li>收取交易者支付的手续费（通常 0.3%）</li>\n<li>可能额外获得协议代币激励</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[流动性提供者] --&gt; B[&quot;存入 ETH + USDC (50:50)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[获得 LP Token]&#10;&#10;    D[交易者] --&gt; E[&quot;在池中交换 ETH↔USDC&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;支付 0.3% 手续费&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;手续费分配给 LP&quot;]&#10;&#10;    H[协议] --&gt; I[&quot;额外代币激励(可选)&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; G&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; J[&quot;LP 收益 = 手续费 + 激励 - 无常损失&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[流动性提供者] --&gt; B[\"存入 ETH + USDC (50:50)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[获得 LP Token]\n\n    D[交易者] --&gt; E[\"在池中交换 ETH↔USDC\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"支付 0.3% 手续费\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"手续费分配给 LP\"]\n\n    H[协议] --&gt; I[\"额外代币激励(可选)\"]\n    I --&gt; G\n\n    C --&gt; J[\"LP 收益 = 手续费 + 激励 - 无常损失\"]\n</pre><h2 id=\"无常损失的数学推导\">无常损失的数学推导</h2><p>无常损失（Impermanent Loss, IL）是流动性提供者面临的核心风险——当池中两种代币的价格比发生变化时，LP 的资产价值低于简单持有（HODL）的价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"精确公式推导\">精确公式推导</h3><p>设初始价格比为 1:P₀，价格变化后为 1:P₁，定义价格变化倍数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = P_1 / P_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>根据恒定乘积公式和 LP 份额计算，无常损失为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IL = \\frac{2\\sqrt{r}}{1 + r} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2466em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4773em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"数值示例\">数值示例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>价格变化 (r)</th>\n<th>无常损失</th>\n<th>解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1.0x（不变）</td>\n<td>0%</td>\n<td>价格不变则无损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.25x（涨25%）</td>\n<td>-0.6%</td>\n<td>温和变动，损失很小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.5x（涨50%）</td>\n<td>-2.0%</td>\n<td>开始有感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2.0x（翻倍）</td>\n<td>-5.7%</td>\n<td>显著损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.0x（涨200%）</td>\n<td>-13.4%</td>\n<td>严重损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.0x（涨400%）</td>\n<td>-25.5%</td>\n<td>极端损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5x（跌50%）</td>\n<td>-5.7%</td>\n<td>对称的：涨跌同幅度损失相同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.2x（跌80%）</td>\n<td>-25.5%</td>\n<td>与涨5倍对称</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"关键洞察\">关键洞察</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>对称性</strong>：价格涨 2x 和跌到 0.5x 的无常损失相同（5.7%）</li>\n<li><strong>非线性增长</strong>：损失随价格偏离加速增大</li>\n<li><strong>「无常」的含义</strong>：如果价格回到初始比例，损失消失——但实践中不保证回归</li>\n<li><strong>方向无关</strong>：无论哪个代币涨/跌，只要价格比变化就有损失</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"uniswap-v3-集中流动性的无常损失\">Uniswap V3 集中流动性的无常损失</h3><p>Uniswap V3 允许 LP 在特定价格范围内提供流动性（集中流动性），这放大了资本效率但也<strong>放大了无常损失</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mtext>全范围流动性</mtext><mtext>集中范围宽度</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IL_{V3} = IL_{V2} \\times \\frac{\\text{全范围流动性}}{\\text{集中范围宽度}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">集中范围宽度</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全范围流动性</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>如果你将流动性集中在 ±10% 范围内（相当于 ~5x 资本效率），无常损失也被放大约 5 倍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"协议风险分层\">协议风险分层</h2><h3 id=\"风险层次模型\">风险层次模型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[流动性挖矿风险层次] --&gt; B[第一层: 智能合约风险]&#10;    A --&gt; C[第二层: 经济机制风险]&#10;    A --&gt; D[第三层: 治理/操作风险]&#10;    A --&gt; E[第四层: 系统性风险]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;合约漏洞 → 资金被盗&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;审计覆盖度&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;无常损失&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;清算级联&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[&quot;预言机操纵&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;恶意治理提案&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;Rug Pull&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[&quot;前端攻击&quot;]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[&quot;稳定币脱锚&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[&quot;跨链桥攻击&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[&quot;监管打击&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[流动性挖矿风险层次] --&gt; B[第一层: 智能合约风险]\n    A --&gt; C[第二层: 经济机制风险]\n    A --&gt; D[第三层: 治理/操作风险]\n    A --&gt; E[第四层: 系统性风险]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[\"合约漏洞 → 资金被盗\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"审计覆盖度\"]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[\"无常损失\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"清算级联\"]\n    C --&gt; C3[\"预言机操纵\"]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[\"恶意治理提案\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"Rug Pull\"]\n    D --&gt; D3[\"前端攻击\"]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[\"稳定币脱锚\"]\n    E --&gt; E2[\"跨链桥攻击\"]\n    E --&gt; E3[\"监管打击\"]\n</pre><h3 id=\"各层风险的历史损失\">各层风险的历史损失</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险类型</th>\n<th>主要案例</th>\n<th>损失规模</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>合约漏洞</td>\n<td>Euler (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>197</mn><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>、</mtext><mi>W</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">197M)、Wormhole (</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">197</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mh</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span></span></span></span></span>320M)</td>\n<td>单次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1M-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>600M</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经济攻击</td>\n<td>Mango Markets ($114M)</td>\n<td>单次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10M-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>200M</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Pull</td>\n<td>Squid Game Token, 各类匿名项目</td>\n<td>累计数十亿</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桥攻击</td>\n<td>Ronin (<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>624</mn><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>、</mtext><mi>N</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">624M)、Nomad (</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">624</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span></span></span></span></span>190M)</td>\n<td>单次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100M-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span></span></span></span></span>600M</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稳定币脱锚</td>\n<td>LUNA/UST ($40B+)</td>\n<td>系统性</td>\n<td>低但致命</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"智能合约审计\">智能合约审计</h2><h3 id=\"审计的局限性\">审计的局限性</h3><p>审计是必要条件但非充分条件——经过审计的协议仍然可能被攻破：</p>\n<p><strong>审计能做到的</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发现已知漏洞类型（重入攻击、整数溢出等）</li>\n<li>验证代码逻辑与文档一致</li>\n<li>识别权限控制缺陷</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>审计做不到的</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>预见所有组合攻击向量（协议间的交互漏洞）</li>\n<li>评估经济机制设计的鲁棒性</li>\n<li>保证升级后的新代码安全</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"评估协议安全性的实用指标\">评估协议安全性的实用指标</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>安全信号</th>\n<th>危险信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>审计次数</td>\n<td>≥3 家独立审计</td>\n<td>0-1 家或仅自审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时间</td>\n<td>&gt;2 年无安全事件</td>\n<td>&lt;6 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TVL 规模</td>\n<td>&gt;10 亿美元</td>\n<td>&lt;1000 万美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bug Bounty</td>\n<td>&gt;$1M 奖金池</td>\n<td>无或 &lt;$10K</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码开源</td>\n<td>完全开源+验证</td>\n<td>闭源或部分开源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>团队身份</td>\n<td>实名、有声誉</td>\n<td>完全匿名</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间锁</td>\n<td>24-48h 治理时间锁</td>\n<td>无时间锁、即时执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"真实收益-vs-代币激励\">真实收益 vs 代币激励</h2><h3 id=\"核心区分\">核心区分</h3><p><strong>真实收益</strong>（Real Yield）：来自协议实际经济活动的收入</p>\n<ul>\n<li>交易手续费（DEX）</li>\n<li>借贷利差（Lending）</li>\n<li>清算收入</li>\n<li>NFT 版税</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>代币激励</strong>（Token Emissions）：协议用自身代币补贴流动性</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流动性挖矿奖励</li>\n<li>空投预期</li>\n<li>积分/Point 系统</li>\n<li>协议治理代币分发</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"为何区分至关重要\">为何区分至关重要</h3><p>代币激励是不可持续的——当激励减少或代币价格下跌时：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>LP 撤走流动性（追逐更高收益）</li>\n<li>流动性下降导致交易深度变差</li>\n<li>用户迁移到其他协议</li>\n<li>代币价格进一步下跌</li>\n<li>进入「死亡螺旋」</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>评估标准</strong>：如果去掉代币激励后 APY 仍为正，该策略具备可持续性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2024-2026-的-points-元年\">2024-2026 的「Points 元年」</h3><p>2024-2025 年出现的 Points（积分）系统是代币激励的变种——协议用积分代替直接发代币，积分可能在未来兑换为代币（TGE）：</p>\n<p><strong>优势</strong>：延迟了卖压、激励了早期参与 <strong>风险</strong>：兑换比例不确定、积分可能被稀释或作废、Sybil 攻击</p>\n<h3 id=\"真实收益协议案例\">真实收益协议案例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>收入来源</th>\n<th>年化真实收益（对LP）</th>\n<th>可持续性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Uniswap V3 (ETH/USDC)</td>\n<td>交易手续费</td>\n<td>5-20%（随交易量波动）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GMX</td>\n<td>交易手续费 + 清算</td>\n<td>10-30%</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Curve (3pool)</td>\n<td>交易手续费</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aave（存款）</td>\n<td>借贷利差</td>\n<td>2-8%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lido (stETH)</td>\n<td>质押奖励</td>\n<td>3-3.5%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"流动性挖矿策略选择\">流动性挖矿策略选择</h2><h3 id=\"按风险收益分级\">按风险收益分级</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略级别</th>\n<th>典型 APY</th>\n<th>风险等级</th>\n<th>适合人群</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>保守级</td>\n<td>3-8%</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>稳定币对池（USDC/USDT）、蓝筹质押</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平衡级</td>\n<td>8-20%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>主流代币对（ETH/USDC）蓝筹协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激进级</td>\n<td>20-50%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>新协议早期激励、集中流动性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投机级</td>\n<td>50-500%+</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>新链/新协议早期，大部分不可持续</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选择决策框架\">选择决策框架</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>先问「收益从哪来」</strong>：如果答案是「代币激励」且无其他收入，警惕</li>\n<li><strong>评估代币价格风险</strong>：如果收益代币价格跌 80%，实际 APY 是多少？</li>\n<li><strong>计算无常损失阈值</strong>：预期价格波动范围内的 IL 是否会吞噬收益？</li>\n<li><strong>检查退出流动性</strong>：极端情况下能否顺利撤出？</li>\n<li><strong>考虑 Gas 和操作成本</strong>：小额资金的 Gas 费可能吞噬大部分收益</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[流动性挖矿决策] --&gt; B{&quot;收益来源?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|真实收益| C[&quot;评估协议安全性&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|代币激励| D[&quot;评估代币价值+锁仓期&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|混合| E[&quot;计算真实收益占比&quot;]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F{&quot;安全评分 &gt; 70?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;考虑配置&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;Pass&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; I{&quot;代币有基本面?&quot;}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[&quot;限制仓位 &lt; 总配置的20%&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[&quot;高风险投机,限制 &lt; 5%&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[流动性挖矿决策] --&gt; B{\"收益来源?\"}\n    B --&gt;|真实收益| C[\"评估协议安全性\"]\n    B --&gt;|代币激励| D[\"评估代币价值+锁仓期\"]\n    B --&gt;|混合| E[\"计算真实收益占比\"]\n\n    C --&gt; F{\"安全评分 &gt; 70?\"}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"考虑配置\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"Pass\"]\n\n    D --&gt; I{\"代币有基本面?\"}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[\"限制仓位 &lt; 总配置的20%\"]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[\"高风险投机,限制 &lt; 5%\"]\n</pre><h2 id=\"实操建议\">实操建议</h2><h3 id=\"初学者路线\">初学者路线</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>起步</strong>：选择 Curve 3pool（USDC/USDT/DAI）或 Aave 存款——几乎无无常损失</li>\n<li><strong>进阶</strong>：Uniswap V3 的宽范围 ETH/USDC 流动性——学习管理无常损失</li>\n<li><strong>高阶</strong>：集中流动性 + 主动管理——需要更多时间和专业知识</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"关键原则\">关键原则</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>永远不要把全部加密资产投入流动性挖矿</strong>：保留核心 HODL 仓位</li>\n<li><strong>收益越高，越要怀疑</strong>：&gt;50% APY 几乎总是不可持续的</li>\n<li><strong>新协议高奖励 ≠ 好机会</strong>：可能是 Rug Pull 的诱饵</li>\n<li><strong>定期收割收益</strong>：不要让奖励代币长期暴露于价格风险</li>\n<li><strong>记录税务事件</strong>：每次 Claim 奖励、Swap、LP 进出都可能产生应税事件</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>流动性挖矿的收益由<strong>手续费 + 代币激励 − 无常损失 − 操作成本</strong>构成，只看 APY 会系统性高估真实回报。</li>\n<li><strong>无常损失</strong>有精确公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi>r</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">IL = \\frac{2\\sqrt{r}}{1+r} - 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4413em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.038em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4739em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord sqrt mtight\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8059em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail mtight\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，其核心特征是<strong>对称性</strong>（涨 2x 与跌到 0.5x 损失同为 5.7%）与<strong>非线性加速</strong>；Uniswap V3 集中流动性会按资本效率倍数放大 IL。</li>\n<li><strong>真实收益 vs 代币激励</strong>是可持续性的分水岭：去掉激励后 APY 仍为正的策略才可持续，否则会陷入撤流动性 → 深度变差 → 迁移 → 代币下跌的死亡螺旋。</li>\n<li>风险分四层（智能合约、经济机制、治理/操作、系统性），历史损失以桥攻击与合约漏洞的单次规模最大，Rug Pull 频率最高。</li>\n<li>选择框架的起点始终是「收益从哪来」，再依次评估协议安全、代币价格风险、无常损失阈值、退出流动性与操作成本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流动性挖矿与风险","id":"流动性挖矿与风险"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"流动性挖矿概述","id":"流动性挖矿概述"},{"level":3,"text":"AMM 基本原理","id":"amm-基本原理"},{"level":2,"text":"无常损失的数学推导","id":"无常损失的数学推导"},{"level":3,"text":"精确公式推导","id":"精确公式推导"},{"level":3,"text":"数值示例","id":"数值示例"},{"level":3,"text":"关键洞察","id":"关键洞察"},{"level":3,"text":"Uniswap V3 集中流动性的无常损失","id":"uniswap-v3-集中流动性的无常损失"},{"level":2,"text":"协议风险分层","id":"协议风险分层"},{"level":3,"text":"风险层次模型","id":"风险层次模型"},{"level":3,"text":"各层风险的历史损失","id":"各层风险的历史损失"},{"level":2,"text":"智能合约审计","id":"智能合约审计"},{"level":3,"text":"审计的局限性","id":"审计的局限性"},{"level":3,"text":"评估协议安全性的实用指标","id":"评估协议安全性的实用指标"},{"level":2,"text":"真实收益 vs 代币激励","id":"真实收益-vs-代币激励"},{"level":3,"text":"核心区分","id":"核心区分"},{"level":3,"text":"为何区分至关重要","id":"为何区分至关重要"},{"level":3,"text":"2024-2026 的「Points 元年」","id":"2024-2026-的-points-元年"},{"level":3,"text":"真实收益协议案例","id":"真实收益协议案例"},{"level":2,"text":"流动性挖矿策略选择","id":"流动性挖矿策略选择"},{"level":3,"text":"按风险收益分级","id":"按风险收益分级"},{"level":3,"text":"选择决策框架","id":"选择决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"实操建议","id":"实操建议"},{"level":3,"text":"初学者路线","id":"初学者路线"},{"level":3,"text":"关键原则","id":"关键原则"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"借贷协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/defi-yield/lending-borrowing"},"next":{"title":"托管方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/crypto-asset-allocation/risk-custody/custody-solutions"}}